3D City (Beijing 3D, Shanghai 3D, Chongqing 3D)
Copyright 2026 mawwalker (https://github.com/mawwalker/3d_city)

This product includes original WebGL 2 3D city rendering software, shaders,
procedural architectural modeling engines, hero landmark & bridge models,
GIS/DEM data pipelines, and cinematic capture tooling developed by mawwalker.

